  "As for motors, you have... <color=red>6</color> more codes to go.": "",
  "Nice going, Taka! You managed to find all the build codes!": "",
  "Why not hit up the drone lab and get those parts developed?": "",
  "Sounds good. That was a refreshing challenge, Hutton-san.": "",
  "What can I say, good racers need good parts. That's all there is to it.": "",
  "Looks like my job here is finished! Now if you'll excuse me, my sweet honey pie needs some tender Hutton lovin'!": "",
  "Oh, but first! I have to ask: do you know any good ramen spots in town?": "",
  "My honey pie's a fiend for those noodles.": "",
  "If we're talking Kamurocho here... Kyushu No. 1 Star's probably your best bet.": "",
  "Kyushu No. 1 Star? Okay, then that's where we'll go!": "",
  "Heh, you two enjoy yourselves. Take care now.": "",
  "See you around, Taka! Goodbye!": "",
  "Taka! Dude, I had no idea ramen could be so delicious! My honey pie said the same thing.": "",
  "In fact, it was so good that I came here again by myself! Hahaha!": "",
